<surname>Bairoch</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Natale</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name><name><surname>Barker</surname><given-names>WC</given-names></name><name><surname>Boeckmann</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Ferro</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Gasteiger</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Huang</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Lopez</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>The Universal Protein Resource (UniProt): an expanding universe of protein information</article-title><source>Nucleic Acids Res</source><year>2006</year><fpage>D187</fpage><lpage>191</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16381842</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/nar/gkj161</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gollery</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Specialized hidden Markov model databases for microbial genomics</article-title><source>Comparative and Functional Genomics</source><year>2003</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>250</fpage><lpage>254</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/cfg.280</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gollery</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>TLFAM &#x02013; A New Set of Protein Family Databases</article-title><source>OMICS A Journal of Integrative Biology</source><year>2002</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>35</fpage><lpage>37</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11881833</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1089/15362310252780825</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tatusov</surname><given-names>RL</given-names></name><name><surna